OL,3,APolice accept Andrew search warrants
OL,4,Awere unlawful, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe criminal investigation is ongoing
OL,7,Fand the items seized in the raids on
OL,8,Fhis homes in Norfolk and Berkshire will
OL,9,Fremain in police custody while his
OL,10,Flegal challenge over this material
OL,11,Fcontinues.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
