OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1791472718
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AItaly approves elections overhaul as
OL,4,Aopposition accuse Meloni of 'scam'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpposition parties say her right-wing
OL,7,Fcoalition has designed the proposals to
OL,8,Fimprove its chance of retaining power
OL,9,Fand, in a heated debate on Thursday,
OL,10,Faccused it of pushing through the
OL,11,F"fraudulent" reform to flout democracy.
OL,13,FMeloni had warned she could resign and
OL,14,Ftrigger an early election if the plans
OL,15,Fwere rejected, with the secret ballot
OL,16,Fseen as a test of her authority.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
